   "file": "pages/home.json",
   "fallback_html": "<h2>Your headline goes here</h2>\n<p>Introduce the brand or the latest drop in one or two short lines.</p>\n<p>Ticker message one</p>\n<p>Ticker message two</p>\n<p>Ticker message three</p>\n<h2>Category tiles</h2>\n<h3>Category 1</h3>\n<h3>Category 2</h3>\n<h3>Category 3</h3>\n<h3>Category 4</h3>\n<h2>New in</h2>\n<h3>Card title 1</h3>\n<h3>Card title 2</h3>\n<h3>Card title 3</h3>\n<h3>Card title 4</h3>\n<h3>Card title 5</h3>\n<h3>Card title 6</h3>\n<h3>Card title 7</h3>\n<h3>Card title 8</h3>\n<h2>Tell the story in two columns</h2>\n<p>Pair a strong image with a few sentences about craft, materials or mission. The image side bleeds to the edge; the sides alternate down the page.</p>\n<h2>A big editorial moment</h2>\n<p>Full-bleed photography with a short line of copy.</p>\n<h2>Why choose us</h2>\n<h3>Benefit one</h3><p>One sentence that supports this point.</p>\n<h3>Benefit two</h3><p>One sentence that supports this point.</p>\n<h3>Benefit three</h3><p>One sentence that supports this point.</p>\n<h3>Benefit four</h3><p>One sentence that supports this point.</p>\n<h2>Join the newsletter</h2>\n<p>Short invitation to subscribe.</p>",
   "thumbnail": "hero-home.jpg"
  },
  {
   "slug": "about",
   "title": "About",
