   "file": "pages/about.json",
   "fallback_html": "<h2>About headline</h2>\n<p>One line that sums up the brand.</p>\n<h2>Introduce the brand</h2>\n<p>Use this block for two or three short paragraphs about where the brand comes from and what it stands for.</p><p>Keep sentences short. The column is limited to a comfortable reading width.</p>\n<h2>First chapter</h2>\n<p>Describe a value, a process or a milestone.</p>\n<h2>Second chapter</h2>\n<p>Describe another value, a process or a milestone.</p>\n<h2>Editorial statement</h2>\n<h2>What we believe</h2>\n<h3>Value one</h3><p>Explain this value in a sentence.</p>\n<h3>Value two</h3><p>Explain this value in a sentence.</p>\n<h3>Value three</h3><p>Explain this value in a sentence.</p>",
